{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you spot all the hidden bananas scattered across tropical islands?</strong><br><br>Welcome to <i>Hidden Bananas</i>, a relaxing and delightful hidden object game set in the heart of the ocean. Explore beautiful island environments filled with charm, secrets, and \u2014 of course \u2014 hidden bananas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/1be0a640c62da5b2dc7c7bae66082e76.poster.avif?t=1749749790\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/1be0a640c62da5b2dc7c7bae66082e76.webm?t=1749749790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/1be0a640c62da5b2dc7c7bae66082e76.mp4?t=1749749790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each level takes you to a different island paradise, where bananas are cleverly tucked away in palm trees, sandy beaches, boats, huts, and more. Look closely and click to collect them all!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/22d69c26c157935c5ebb6c4aed87db08.poster.avif?t=1749749790\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/22d69c26c157935c5ebb6c4aed87db08.webm?t=1749749790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/extras/22d69c26c157935c5ebb6c4aed87db08.mp4?t=1749749790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>[h3]Features:[/h3]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4c 100+ hidden bananas to find across exotic island scenes<br>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Explore sun-soaked beaches, lush vegetation, and ocean views<br>\ud83d\udd0d Simple point-and-click gameplay, perfect for relaxing <br>\ud83c\udfaf Great for all ages \u2013 improve focus while having fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here to relax, challenge your observation skills, or simply enjoy the island vibe, <i>Hidden Bananas</i> is your perfect getaway.</p>[h3]<strong>Can you find them all?</strong> \ud83c\udf4c[/h3]","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694240?t=1749749790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/0c357195c404b2c9928dd6116cd072adfed1a1d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749749790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/a476680c53decb147a66b959fdf9b8e950a45269/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749749790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694240/a476680c53decb147a66b959fdf9b8e950a45269/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749749790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3796460,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you spot all the hidden bananas scattered across tropical islands?</strong><br><br>Welcome to <i>Hidden Bananas</i>, a relaxing and delightful hidden object game set in the heart of the ocean. Explore beautiful island environments filled with charm, secrets, and \u2014 of course \u2014 hidden bananas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class